sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Admin
  participant P as App + its server
  participant J as Backend + database
  participant M as M-Pesa B2C
  A->>P: Pay entry, loan or refund
  P->>J: GET send-money/recipient
  J-->>P: Name, phone, amount
  A->>P: Checks bold details, confirms
  P->>J: POST send-money
  Note over J: Admin only, still unpaid,<br/>nothing in flight for 10 min.<br/>Saved as SEND_MONEY PENDING
  J->>M: B2C BusinessPayment
  M-->>J: ConversationID
  loop While the transfer shows
    P->>J: GET status
  end
  M->>J: POST .../b2c-result
  Note over J: Success: receipt saved, entry paid,<br/>trip profit updated.<br/>Failure: reason saved
  P-->>A: Receipt, or the reason
